't slack off- their patience is always ticking! \n\nYou'll be easily immersed with the intuitive gameplay and Pixar-inspired visuals. \nWith your progressing skills, business will quickly boom, both a blessing and a curse. \nCustomers will be harder to please, robbers will steal your cash and if you don't keep up your standards, you'll find yourself out on the streets again!\n\n**Features:**\n- Over 30 levels in single player mode\n- Endless mode\n- 12 unique recipes to master.\n\n**Coming later:**\n- Zombie mode where you have to throw pizzas at the undead before they come and eat you.\n- Asymmetric online multiplayer mode.  Play as the chef in VR, while someone on the same PC plays as a waiter on mouse and keyboard.\n- More! We want to develop the features YOU want.", "short_description": "Pizza Master VR is a fast paced pizza making game for Virtual Reality. Work as a chef and wield 8 core ingredients to create a wide range of pizzas to satisfy your customers. But don't slack off- their patience is always ticking!"}]}, "developer_name": "Plectrum XR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://plectrumxr.com/privacy-policy?fbclid=IwAR3TE2ug7boo8sc3jzgTy9dn-w56Irpbb_xv2wMSD_zoUhWW8wt910IKr18", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Plectrum XR", "support_website_url": "http://plectrumxr.com/", "website_url": "https://plectrumxr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "FOOD", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": 